  "title": "Blueberry Zucchini Bread",
  "description": "Yummy blueberry zucchini bread packed with juicy, fresh blueberries and shredded zucchini. This recipe makes 4 mini loaves — perfect for gift-giving!",
  "authors": [
    "Laura Moody"
  ],
